          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("story/cave-rails-glow.webp~CS(-15,-40,-70)"),
            text: _("The journey to the far northern wastelands was long and perilous. The tunnels were narrow, but by following the old mining rails, Rugnur and his group could make good time. After a few days journey, they saw a dim red glow in the tunnel ahead and could feel sporadic vibrations in the rails."),
          },
        ],
      },
